    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1381">

                <pb facs="1307" n="1141" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg1141"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 817.51/1002</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Managua</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-09-18T15:00:00-05:45">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 18, 1917, 3 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Department’s September 12, 5 p.m.<anchor n="6" xml:id="d1381-f1"/> In
                    addition to note of Minister for Foreign Affairs reported in my September 12, 3
                    p.m., authorizing Enriquez to represent Nicaragua, I have obtained and have in
                    my possession in legal form power of attorney authorizing him to arrange and
                    conclude agreements with the bankers. Will forward this document by first
                    pouch.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jefferson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
